    "The CROSS-LANGUAGE conformance vector for `Authorize` call_sig v3 (#1059; design plans/u-authorize-call-v3-design.md).",
    "",
    "Contract: signed_payload = framed(`seam-authorize-call-v3`) | framed(ticket) | framed(tool_input_digest) | framed(tool_name) | framed(agent_id) |",
    "framed(subject) | framed(u32_LE(n_subjects)) | framed(subjects[0]) ... | framed(client_request_id) | framed(session_id) |",
    "framed(u32_LE(n_features)) | framed(key) | framed(value) ..., with framed(x) = u32_little_endian(len_bytes(x)) | x.",
